{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\n# Ref. '5.3 CQL Spørringer' in report.\n## CQL Queries and Analysis of Results\n___\n**Note**  \nThis notebook is part of a collections which has to be run in the following order to work as intended:\n1. [1_Capstone_CQL_DB_Build.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone)\n2. [2_Capstone_Frame_to_Table.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone)\n3. [3_Capstone_Cassandra_Queries.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone)\n___\nThis notebook contains a collection of queries intended to affirm or reject the hypothesises, which the capstone project is built around.  \nEach query have a customised graphical illustration of the results which has been used to evaluate of the given hypothesis should be considered valid or not.  \nThe final evaluation of the hypothesis can be found in the final report under section `5.6 Resultat`.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-20T00:18:33+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>Ref. &lsquo;5.3 CQL Spørringer&rsquo; in report.</h1>\n<h2>CQL Queries and Analysis of Results</h2>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Note</strong><br />\nThis notebook is part of a collections which has to be run in the following order to work as intended:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone\">1_Capstone_CQL_DB_Build.zpln</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone\">2_Capstone_Frame_to_Table.zpln</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone\">3_Capstone_Cassandra_Queries.zpln</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr />\n<p>This notebook contains a collection of queries intended to affirm or reject the hypothesises, which the capstone project is built around.<br />\nEach query have a customised graphical illustration of the results which has been used to evaluate of the given hypothesis should be considered valid or not.<br />\nThe final evaluation of the hypothesis can be found in the final report under section <code>5.6 Resultat</code>.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763574848494_750068970","id":"paragraph_1763574848494_750068970","dateCreated":"2025-11-19T17:54:08+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-20T00:18:33+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-20T00:18:34+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n### Hypothesis 1\nDen totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad gjennom én time er høyest i rushtiden hverdager mellom 15 : 00 og 16 : 00.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-19T22:51:46+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Hypothesis 1</h3>\n<p>Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad gjennom én time er høyest i rushtiden hverdager mellom 15 : 00 og 16 : 00.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763592702986_850505391","id":"paragraph_1763592702986_850505391","dateCreated":"2025-11-19T22:51:43+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-19T22:51:46+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-19T22:51:46+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Description\nThis query is designed to retrieve traffic data for the *Glemmen* area over a one-week period. It returns all hourly registrations within this timeframe, allowing the traffic volume to be analysed in order to identify rush-hour patterns.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T12:53:07+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Description</h4>\n<p>This query is designed to retrieve traffic data for the <em>Glemmen</em> area over a one-week period. It returns all hourly registrations within this timeframe, allowing the traffic volume to be analysed in order to identify rush-hour patterns.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763975059864_1883962697","id":"paragraph_1763975059864_1883962697","dateCreated":"2025-11-24T09:04:19+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-24T12:53:07+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-24T12:53:07+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true},{"text":"%md\n#### Results\nTo illustrate and evaluate the results of this query, a *plot diagram* has been generated showing the traffic volume for each hourly interval over a 24-hour period during the timeframe from **2024-03-04** to **2024-03-10** at the monitoring point in *Glemmen*.\nHere, we can observe that the average traffic volume is highest between **15:00 and 16:00**, with the exception of Saturday **2024-03-09**. Since this hypothesis focuses exclusively on weekdays, this outlier can be disregarded.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T12:56:29+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763988741227_1608057020","id":"paragraph_1763988741227_1608057020","dateCreated":"2025-11-24T12:52:21+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true,"dateFinished":"2025-11-24T12:56:29+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-24T12:56:29+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Results</h4>\n<p>To illustrate and evaluate the results of this query, a <em>plot diagram</em> has been generated showing the traffic volume for each hourly interval over a 24-hour period during the timeframe from <strong>2024-03-04</strong> to <strong>2024-03-10</strong> at the monitoring point in <em>Glemmen</em>.<br />\nHere, we can observe that the average traffic volume is highest between <strong>15:00 and 16:00</strong>, with the exception of Saturday <strong>2024-03-09</strong>. Since this hypothesis focuses exclusively on weekdays, this outlier can be disregarded.</p>\n\n</div>"}]}},{"text":"%cassandra\r\nUSE capstone_ks;\r\n\r\nSELECT * FROM rushtid\r\n    WHERE navn = 'Glemmen'\r\n    AND dato >= '2024-03-04'\r\n    AND dato <= '2024-03-10';","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-20T00:02:28+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{"0":{"graph":{"mode":"scatterChart","height":370.08331298828125,"optionOpen":false,"setting":{"multiBarChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","stacked":false},"lineChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","forceY":false,"lineWithFocus":false,"isDateFormat":false,"dateFormat":""},"scatterChart":{"xAxis":{"name":"dato","index":2,"aggr":"sum"},"yAxis":{"name":"trafikkmengde","index":4,"aggr":"sum"},"group":{"name":"fra","index":3,"aggr":"sum"}},"stackedAreaChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","style":"stack"}},"keys":[{"name":"dato","index":2,"aggr":"sum"}],"groups":[{"name":"fra","index":3,"aggr":"sum"}],"values":[{"name":"trafikkmengde","index":4,"aggr":"sum"}]}}},"enabled":true,"edi