Glemmen\t2024-03-09\t20\t576\t21\tSat\nGlemmen\t2024-03-09\t21\t530\t22\tSat\nGlemmen\t2024-03-09\t22\t535\t23\tSat\nGlemmen\t2024-03-09\t23\t545\t24\tSat\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t1\t287\t2\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t2\t221\t3\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t3\t159\t4\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t5\t42\t6\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t6\t66\t7\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t7\t151\t8\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t8\t165\t9\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t10\t560\t11\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t11\t784\t12\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t12\t1008\t13\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t14\t1281\t15\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t15\t1284\t16\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t16\t1107\t17\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t17\t1004\t18\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t18\t932\t19\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t19\t893\t20\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t21\t459\t22\tSun\nGlemmen\t2024-03-10\t24\t473\t1\tSun\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762961233203_734482906","id":"paragraph_1762894811222_1016264217","dateCreated":"2025-11-12T15:27:13+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-19T22:50:41+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-19T22:50:41+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Conlusion\nBased on this finding, it can be concluded that the hypothesis is true, as the total traffic volume entering and leaving Fredrikstad within a one-hour period is highest during weekday rush hours between **15:00** and **16:00**.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T12:57:26+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Conlusion</h4>\n<p>Based on this finding, it can be concluded that the hypothesis is true, as the total traffic volume entering and leaving Fredrikstad within a one-hour period is highest during weekday rush hours between <strong>15:00</strong> and <strong>16:00</strong>.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763974980369_2040320895","id":"paragraph_1763974980369_2040320895","dateCreated":"2025-11-24T09:03:00+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-24T12:57:26+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-24T12:57:26+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true},{"text":"%md\n### Hypothesis 2\nDen totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad er lavere i juli måned enn for resten av året.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-19T22:52:18+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Hypothesis 2</h3>\n<p>Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad er lavere i juli måned enn for resten av året.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763592735469_1241557548","id":"paragraph_1763592735469_1241557548","dateCreated":"2025-11-19T22:52:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-19T22:52:18+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-19T22:52:18+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Description\nThis query is designed to retrieve a monthly count of the total car traffic volume at *Glemmen* for the years **2022** up to the most recently recorded point.\nThis allows for a comparison of the traffic volume in July against other months of the year in order to validate the hypothesis.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T12:57:58+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Description</h4>\n<p>This query is designed to retrieve a monthly count of the total car traffic volume at <em>Glemmen</em> for the years <strong>2022</strong> up to the most recently recorded point.<br />\nThis allows for a comparison of the traffic volume in July against other months of the year in order to validate the hypothesis.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763975083279_1694928815","id":"paragraph_1763975083279_1694928815","dateCreated":"2025-11-24T09:04:43+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-24T12:57:58+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-24T12:57:58+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true},{"text":"%md\n#### Results\nTo evaluate our hypothesis, a *line chart* has been generated showing the total monthly car traffic volume at the *Glemmen* monitoring point for all years in the period from **2022** to **2025**.\nHere, we can observe that the traffic volume in July decreases compared to the other months of the year.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T13:03:36+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763989212908_1570110498","id":"paragraph_1763989212908_1570110498","dateCreated":"2025-11-24T13:00:12+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true,"dateFinished":"2025-11-24T13:03:36+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-24T13:03:36+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Results</h4>\n<p>To evaluate our hypothesis, a <em>line chart</em> has been generated showing the total monthly car traffic volume at the <em>Glemmen</em> monitoring point for all years in the period from <strong>2022</strong> to <strong>2025</strong>.<br />\nHere, we can observe that the traffic volume in July decreases compared to the other months of the year.</p>\n\n</div>"}]}},{"text":"%cassandra\nUSE capstone_ks;\n\nSELECT * FROM trafikkmengde_mnd\n    WHERE navn = 'Glemmen'\n    AND yr >= 2022;","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T12:57:50+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{"0":{"graph":{"mode":"lineChart","height":300,"optionOpen":false,"setting":{"lineChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","forceY":true,"lineWithFocus":false,"isDateFormat":false,"dateFormat":""},"stackedAreaChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","style":"stack"},"scatterChart":{"xAxis":{"name":"yr","index":1,"aggr":"sum"},"yAxis":{"name":"trafikkmengde","index":3,"aggr":"sum"},"group":{"name":"mnd","index":2,"aggr":"sum"}},"multiBarChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","stacked":false}},"keys":[{"name":"mnd","index":2,"aggr":"sum"}],"groups":[{"name":"yr","index":1,"aggr":"sum"}],"values":[{"name":"trafikkmengde","index":3,"aggr":"sum"}]}}},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":false},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TABLE","data":"navn\tyr\tmnd\ttrafikkmengde\nGlemmen\t2022\t1\t708989\nGlemmen\t2022\t2\t669775\nGlemmen\t2022\t3\t804964\nGlemmen\t2022\t4\t747775\nGlemmen\t2022\t5\t831720\nGlemmen\t2022\t6\t797206\nGlemmen\t2022\t7\t430139\nGlemmen\t2022\t8\t766867\nGlemmen\t2022\t9\t779101\nGlemmen\t2022\t10\t765853\nGlemmen\t2022\t11\t788274\nGlemmen\t2022\t12\t752369\nGlemmen\t2023\t1\t724264\nGlemmen\t2023\t2\t672926\nGlemmen\t2023\t3\t782664\nGlemmen\t2023\t4\t715354\nGlemmen\t2023\t5\t787484\nGlemmen\t2023\t6\t815318\nGlemmen\t2023\t7\t695712\nGlemmen\t2023\t8\t812959\nGlemmen\t2023\t9\t801739\nGlemmen\t2023\t10\t817542\nGlemmen\t2023\t11\t819428\nGlemmen\t2023\t12\t764977\nGlemmen\t2024\t1\t743887\nGlemmen\t2024\t2\t728209\nGlemmen\t2024\t3\t738034\nGlemmen\t2024\t4\t779067\nGlemmen\t2024\t5\t789345\nGlemmen\t2024\t6\t763922\nGlemmen\t2024\t7\t664278\nGlemmen\t2024\t8\t756429\nGlemmen\t2024\t9\t752283\nGlemmen\t2024\t10\t800157\nGlemmen\t2024\t11\t779613\nGlemmen\t2024\t12\t737700\nGlemmen\t2025\t1\t9809\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763312475259_606803304","id":"paragraph_1763312475259_606803304","dateCreated":"2025-11-16T17:01:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-20T00:10:34+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-20T00:10:34+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Conlusion\nBased on this finding, there are strong indications that the hypothesis is true, as the total traffic volume entering and leaving Fredrikstad is lower in July than during the rest of the year.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T12:58:56+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Conlusion</h4>\n<p>Based on this finding, there are strong indications that the hypothesis is true, as the total traffic volume entering and leaving Fredrikstad is lower in July than during the rest of the year.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763974975504_715396306","id":"paragraph_1763974975504_715396306","dateCreated":"2025-11-24T09:02:55+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-24T12:58:56+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-24T12:58:56+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true},{"text":"%md\n### Hypothesis 3\nDet finnes en positiv korrelasjon for temperatur og total sykkeltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10 : 00 − 14 : 00.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-19T22:52:44+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Hypothesis 3</h3>\n<p>Det finnes en positiv korrelasjon for temperatur og total sykkeltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10 : 00 − 14 : 00.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763592751668_1112372502","id":"paragraph_1763592751668_1112372502","dateCreated":"2025-11-19T22:52:31+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-19T22:52:44+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-19T22:52:44+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Description\nThis query retrieves bicycle traffic data and the corresponding air temperature at the *Wilbergjordet* monitoring point over a defined time period.\nThis enables an analysis of the correlation between temperature and bicycle traffic within the specified timeframe.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T12:59:37+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Description</h4>\n<p>This query retrieves bicycle traffic data and the corresponding air temperature at the <em>Wilbergjordet</em> monitoring point over a defined time period.<br />\nThis enables an analysis of the correlation between temperature and bicycle traffic within the specified timeframe.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763975088282_1200138763","id":"paragraph_1763975088282_1200138763","dateCreated":"2025-11-24T09:04:48+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-24T12:59:37+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-24T12:59:37+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true},{"text":"%md\n#### Results\nTo analyse this hypothesis, we extracted data for the measurement point *Wilbergjordet* for the period from **2022-02-01** to **2025-10-01**.\nSince Zeppelin is not capable of generating the required analyses, the values were exported to Excel.\nTo perform the analysis, we created scatter plots with traffic volume as the *y*-values and temperature as the *x*-values, and added a corresponding trendline to each plot.\nWe also removed a small number of outlier values (5) to produce a clearer and more readable plot, as these points were far outside the normal value range of the dataset.  \n\nThere were some techical difficulties with generating a good scatterplot that illustrated our data in a readable matter. Therefore the visuals for this hyophesis can be found inside the appended report under section `5.6.4 Hypotese 3`.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T13:10:15+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763989435541_748220500","id":"paragraph_1763989435541_748220500","dateCreated":"2025-11-24T13:03:55+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true,"dateFinished":"2025-11-24T13:10:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-24T13:10:15+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Results</h4>\n<p>To analyse this hypothesis, we extracted data for the measurement point <em>Wilbergjordet</em> for the period from <strong>2022-02-01</strong> to <strong>2025-10-01</strong>.<br />\nSince Zeppelin is not capable of generating the required analyses, the values were exported to Excel.<br />\nTo perform the analysis, we created scatter plots with traffic volume as the <em>y</em>-values and temperature as the <em>x</em>-values, and added a corresponding trendline to each plot.<br />\nWe also removed a small number of outlier values (5) to produce a clearer and more readable plot, as these points were far outside the normal value range of the dataset.</p>\n<p>There were some techical difficulties with generating a good scatterplot that illustrated our data in a readable matter. Therefore the visuals for this hyophesis can be found inside the appended report under section <code>5.6.4 Hypotese 3</code>.</p>\n\n</div>"}]}},{"text":"%cassandra\nSELECT navn, trafikkmengde, lufttemperatur FROM capstone_ks.sykkel_temp_corr\nWHERE navn = 'Wilbergjordet'\nAND dato >= '2022-02-01'\nAND dato < '2025-10-01';","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T12:59:22+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":false},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TABLE","data":"navn\ttrafikkmengde\tlufttemperatur\nWilbergjordet\t6\t-3.4\nWilbergjordet\t7\t-3.3\nWilbergjordet\t2\t-3.2\nWilbergjordet\t5\t-2.8\nWilbergjordet\t0\t-4\nWilbergjordet\t1\t-2.8\nWilbergjordet\t4\t-1.2\nWilbergjordet\t7\t-0.9\nWilbergjordet\t0\t-1.2\nWilbergjordet\t2\t-0.7\nWilbergjordet\t3\t-0.3\nWilbergjordet\t4\t0.1\nWilbergjordet\t2\t5.2\nWilbergjordet\t0\t5\nWilbergjordet\t5\t4.6\nWilbergjordet\t6\t4.3\nWilbergjordet\t3\t4\nWilbergjordet\t3\t3.7\nWilbergjordet\t7\t3.7\nWilbergjordet\t9\t3.8\nWilbergjordet\t2\t3.3\nWilbergjordet\t0\t3.5\nWilbergjordet\t3\t3.7\nWilbergjordet\t5\t3.6\nWilbergjordet\t3\t3.5\nWilbergjordet\t5\t4.3\nWilbergjordet\t4\t4.8\nWilbergjordet\t5\t5.4\nWilbergjordet\t5\t5.8\nWilbergjordet\t8\t6\nWilbergjordet\t6\t6\nWilbergjordet\t3\t6\nWilbergjordet\t3\t5.8\nWilbergjordet\t5\t5.8\nWilbergjordet\t6\t6\nWilbergjordet\t6\t5.3\nWilbergjordet\t2\t4\nWilbergjordet\t6\t4.1\nWilbergjordet\t11