tus":"FINISHED","focus":true},{"text":"%md\n### Hypothesis 4\nDet finnes en negativ korrelasjon for temperatur og total biltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10 : 00 − 14 : 00.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-19T22:53:17+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Hypothesis 4</h3>\n<p>Det finnes en negativ korrelasjon for temperatur og total biltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10 : 00 − 14 : 00.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763592793498_1916122811","id":"paragraph_1763592793498_1916122811","dateCreated":"2025-11-19T22:53:13+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-19T22:53:17+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-19T22:53:17+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Description\nThe query retrieves car traffic data and the corresponding air temperature at the *Stabburet* monitoring point over a defined time period.\nThis enables an analysis of the correlation between temperature and car traffic within the specified timeframe.\n\nThere were some techical difficulties with generating a good scatterplot that illustrated our data in a readable matter. Therefore the visuals for this hyophesis can be found inside the appended report under section `5.6.5 Hypotese 4`.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T13:10:48+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Description</h4>\n<p>The query retrieves car traffic data and the corresponding air temperature at the <em>Stabburet</em> monitoring point over a defined time period.<br />\nThis enables an analysis of the correlation between temperature and car traffic within the specified timeframe.</p>\n<p>There were some techical difficulties with generating a good scatterplot that illustrated our data in a readable matter. Therefore the visuals for this hyophesis can be found inside the appended report under section <code>5.6.5 Hypotese 4</code>.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763975094362_946388259","id":"paragraph_1763975094362_946388259","dateCreated":"2025-11-24T09:04:54+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-24T13:10:48+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-24T13:10:48+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true},{"text":"%md\n#### Results\nTo analyse this hypothesis, we extracted data for the measurement point *Stabburet* for the period from **2022-02-01** to **2025-10-01**.\nAs with Hypothesis 3, the data was exported to Excel in order to perform the analysis there.\nWe produced a corresponding analysis for these values by creating a scatter plot with traffic volume as the *y*-values and temperature as the *x*-values, and added the associated trendline to the plot.\n\nBased on the results shown in the figure, we do not observe any correlation, with an ( r^2 ) value of only **0.0016**, indicating that there is no negative correlation between car traffic and temperature for this dataset.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T13:12:02+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763989785488_687482889","id":"paragraph_1763989785488_687482889","dateCreated":"2025-11-24T13:09:45+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true,"dateFinished":"2025-11-24T13:12:02+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-24T13:12:02+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Results</h4>\n<p>To analyse this hypothesis, we extracted data for the measurement point <em>Stabburet</em> for the period from <strong>2022-02-01</strong> to <strong>2025-10-01</strong>.<br />\nAs with Hypothesis 3, the data was exported to Excel in order to perform the analysis there.<br />\nWe produced a corresponding analysis for these values by creating a scatter plot with traffic volume as the <em>y</em>-values and temperature as the <em>x</em>-values, and added the associated trendline to the plot.</p>\n<p>Based on the results shown in the figure, we do not observe any correlation, with an ( r^2 ) value of only <strong>0.0016</strong>, indicating that there is no negative correlation between car traffic and temperature for this dataset.</p>\n\n</div>"}]}},{"text":"%cassandra\nUSE capstone_ks;\n\nSELECT navn, trafikkmengde, lufttemperatur FROM bil_temp_corr\n    WHERE navn = 'Stabburet'\n    AND dato >= '2022-02-01'\n    AND dato < '2025-10-01';","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T13:09:40+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":false},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TABLE","data":"navn\ttrafikkmengde\tlufttemperatur\nStabburet\t1499\t17.5\nStabburet\t1803\t18.9\nStabburet\t1946\t19\nStabburet\t2118\t19.1\nStabburet\t1356\t16.2\nStabburet\t1692\t16.7\nStabburet\t1878\t16.9\nStabburet\t2045\t16.6\nStabburet\t1389\t17.9\nStabburet\t1718\t18\nStabburet\t1892\t18.1\nStabburet\t2076\t18\nStabburet\t1379\t17.8\nStabburet\t1793\t17.4\nStabburet\t1915\t18.2\nStabburet\t2023\t18.2\nStabburet\t1462\t16.4\nStabburet\t1834\t18.1\nStabburet\t2042\t18.7\nStabburet\t2080\t19.2\nStabburet\t1034\t16.