 trafikkmålinger","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T08:57:49+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Hypothesis 5</h3>\n<p>Data kan benyttes til å forutsi om det er blitt utført veiarbeid eller vedlikehold på et gitt trafikk registreringspunkt basert på uregelmessigheter i trafikkmålinger</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763592817521_1484181062","id":"paragraph_1763592817521_1484181062","dateCreated":"2025-11-19T22:53:37+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-24T08:57:49+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-24T08:57:52+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\n#### Description\nThis query is designed to retrieve all existing records over time where ( \\text{dekningsgrad (%)} = 0 ) at the *Simo* traffic monitoring point.\nHere, we can analyse patterns in the data to identify potential irregularities that may indicate roadwork or maintenance activities.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T13:13:45+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Description</h4>\n<p>This query is designed to retrieve all existing records over time where ( \\text{dekningsgrad (%)} = 0 ) at the <em>Simo</em> traffic monitoring point.<br />\nHere, we can analyse patterns in the data to identify potential irregularities that may indicate roadwork or maintenance activities.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763975101013_94569438","id":"paragraph_1763975101013_94569438","dateCreated":"2025-11-24T09:05:01+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-24T13:13:45+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-24T13:13:45+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true},{"text":"%md\n#### Results\nHere, two graphical representations of the query results for this hypothesis are shown.\nThe first illustration is a *pie chart* displaying the distribution of records with ( \\text{dekningsgrad (%)} = 0 ) at the *Simo* monitoring point. This is used to assess whether certain times of the year exhibit a higher occurrence of missing coverage. We can observe that the year **2022** contains the majority of these records. It may therefore be of interest to examine whether there are continuous periods within this year that could indicate roadwork or maintenance activity.\n\nThe second illustration is a *line chart* showing a timeline of registrations with ( \\text{dekningsgrad (%)} = 0 ) at the *Simo* traffic monitoring point. Here, we can see a week-long period in May **2022** where the coverage is **0** throughout the entire day. This may indicate that roadwork or maintenance was carried out during this timeframe.\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T13:14:41+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1763989974099_1802061763","id":"paragraph_1763989974099_1802061763","dateCreated":"2025-11-24T13:12:54+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true,"dateFinished":"2025-11-24T13:14:41+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-24T13:14:41+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Results</h4>\n<p>Here, two graphical representations of the query results for this hypothesis are shown.<br />\nThe first illustration is a <em>pie chart</em> displaying the distribution of records with ( \\text{dekningsgrad (%)} = 0 ) at the <em>Simo</em> monitoring point. This is used to assess whether certain times of the year exhibit a higher occurrence of missing coverage. We can observe that the year <strong>2022</strong> contains the majority of these records. It may therefore be of interest to examine whether there are continuous periods within this year that could indicate roadwork or maintenance activity.</p>\n<p>The second illustration is a <em>line chart</em> showing a timeline of registrations with ( \\text{dekningsgrad (%)} = 0 ) at the <em>Simo</em> traffic monitoring point. Here, we can see a week-long period in May <strong>2022</strong> where the coverage is <strong>0</strong> throughout the entire day. This may indicate that roadwork or maintenance was carried out during this timeframe.</p>\n\n</div>"}]}},{"text":"%cassandra\nUSE capstone_ks;\n\nSELECT * FROM veiarbeid\n\tWHERE navn = 'Simo';","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-24T08:25:54+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":6,"fontSize":9,"results":{"0":{"graph":{"mode":"pieChart","height":300,"optionOpen":false,"setting":{"lineChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"rotate","forceY":false,"lineWithFocus":false,"isDateFormat":false,"dateFormat":""},"stackedAreaChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","style":"stack"},"scatterChart":{},"multiBarChart":{"rotate":{"degree":"-45"},"xLabelStatus":"default","stacked":false}},"keys":[{"name":"navn","index":0,"aggr":"sum"}],"groups":[{"name":"dato","index":1,"aggr":"sum"}],"values":[{"name":"fra","index":2,"aggr":"count"}]}}},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":false},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TABLE","data":"navn\tdato\tfra\nSimo\t2020-01-16\t8\nSimo\t2020-01-16\t9\nSimo\t2020-02-05\t18\nSimo\t2020-02-05\t19\nSimo\t2020-02-05\t20\